Alternatively, a tadpole can be prevented from aging when a player uses a [[golden dandelion]], allowing it to remain as a tadpole indefinitely, or until another golden dandelion is used on it to cause its aging to resume.

Unlike all other mobs with baby variants, the tadpole is treated by the game as a completely different mob from the frog.

